OL,3,GNEWSAHow an empty shop became Britain's
OL,4,Abest pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight years ago, an empty building
OL,7,Fstanding in the shadow of Tamworth
OL,8,FCastle was a forgotten tourist
OL,9,Finformation centre with overgrown
OL,10,Foutdoor space and boarded-up rooms.
OL,12,FThe same Tudor property is now the
OL,13,FTamworth Tap, recently crowned Overall
OL,14,FGreat British Pub of the Year and Best
OL,15,FBeer Pub, attracting visitors from
OL,16,Facross the country for its cask ales,
OL,17,Fhistoric surroundings and coveted
OL,18,Fcastle views.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
