OL,3,GNEWSAHow an empty shop became Britain's
OL,4,Abest pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut according to owners George and
OL,7,FLouise Greenaway, becoming an
OL,8,Faward-winning pub was never part of the
OL,9,Fplan.
OL,11,F"When Tamworth Brewing Co was
OL,12,Festablished, the original plan was
OL,13,Fsimply to create a small brewery in
OL,14,FTamworth," said George.
